{"seq":3,"slug":"founder-of-sciences","title":"Founder Of Sciences","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/core-contributions/founder-of-sciences","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-father-of-biology","title":"生物学之父","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/core-contributions/founder-of-sciences/the-father-of-biology","wordCount":1940,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"ethics-and-politics-as-science","title":"伦理学与政治学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/core-contributions/founder-of-sciences/ethics-and-politics-as-science","wordCount":2008,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现亚里士多德作为诸多学科开创者的贡献。他被誉为\"生物学之父\"——第一个对动物世界进行了系统的、基于经验观察的研究；他还在\"实践科学\"领域，系统地建立了伦理学与政治学——《尼各马可伦理学》奠定了德性伦理学，《政治学》则以经验比较的方法奠定了政治学。本章揭示亚里士多德开创诸多学科的伟大贡献。\n"}